{
    "title": "Super Teacher",
    "description": "Get unlimited tutoring for ages 3\u20138. Over 100,000 parents have given their families a leg up with Super Teacher. The first lesson in every subject is free.\r\n\r\nYou can unlock the full version, including all the lessons, for $4.17/month with an annual subscription, or $10/month with the monthly plan.\r\n\r\nWith Super Teacher, your family can get private lessons in any subject including \r\n\ud83d\udccc Reading\r\n\ud83d\udccc Math\r\n\ud83d\udccc Science\r\n\ud83d\udccc Art\r\n\ud83d\udccc Poetry\r\n\ud83d\udccc Social-emotional skills\r\n\ud83d\udccc Geography\r\n\ud83d\udccc \u2026and more!\r\n\r\nPopular READING courses include\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Letter sounds\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Learn to Write Letters\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Learn to Write Numbers\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Learn to Read\r\n     - 3-letter words\r\n     - Blended sounds\r\n     - Silent E\r\n     - Verbs & adjective\r\n     - \u2026and many more\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Reading Comprehension\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Introduction to Poetry\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Greek Mythology\r\n\r\nPopular MATH courses include\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Number Sense 1\u2013100\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Lean to Add\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Learn to Subtract\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Learn to Multiple\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Learn to Divide\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Intro to Fractions\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Estimation & Rounding\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Word Problems\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Adding 2-digit numbers\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Number Lines\r\n\ud83d\udcd0 Clocks & Telling Time\r\n\r\nOther popular courses include\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Natural Habitats (science)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Simple Machines (science)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d All About Animals (science)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Science stories (science)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Learn to Draw (art)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d The 50 US States (geography)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Social-emotional Stories (SEL)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Fairy Tales & Fables (SEL)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Community Helpers (SEL)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Winnie-the-Pooh (SEL)\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Kindergarten Prep (all subjects)\r\n\r\nFor the Terms of Use, see <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgetsuperteacher.com%2Fterms-of-use&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw1TIoJ8-7MNPhuwyenN06Vo\">https://getsuperteacher.com/terms-of-use</a>.",
